 [17592186326852 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "695bf8dc-adcc-5ba6-b927-749766914d40" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326852 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the formula\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta =\\frac{v\\cdot w}{‖v‖\\,‖w‖},\n$$\n\nwe have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{{v}_{1}{w}_{1}+{v}_{2}{w}_{2}+{v}_{3}{w}_{3}+{v}_{4}{w}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{v}_{1}^{2}+{v}_{2}^{2}+{v}_{3}^{2}+{v}_{4}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{{w}_{1}^{2}+{w}_{2}^{2}+{w}_{3}^{2}+{w}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{7}\\cdot (-\\sqrt{7})+7\\cdot 3+2\\cdot 7+2\\cdot 4}{\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{7})^{2}+{7}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}}\\sqrt{(-\\sqrt{7})^{2}+{3}^{2}+{7}^{2}+{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{36}{\\sqrt{64}\\sqrt{81}} \\\\  & =\\frac{36}{72} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{1}{2})=\\frac{\\pi }{3}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326853 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186326400 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326853 #edb/ref 1069 "q-40566" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326853 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326853 #edb/ref 1071 "Rounded to two decimal places, what is the acute angle between the vectors  $v=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]$ and $w=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ \\text{ }1\\end{aligned}]?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326853 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ca41f5b8-b3cf-55a5-b73c-3a463b4f4955" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326853 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the formula\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta =\\frac{v\\cdot w}{‖v‖\\,‖w‖},\n$$\n\nwe have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{{v}_{1}{w}_{1}+{v}_{2}{w}_{2}+{v}_{3}{w}_{3}+{v}_{4}{w}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{v}_{1}^{2}+{v}_{2}^{2}+{v}_{3}^{2}+{v}_{4}^{2}}\\sqrt{{w}_{1}^{2}+{w}_{2}^{2}+{w}_{3}^{2}+{w}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot (-5)+(-4)\\cdot (-5)+5\\cdot 2+(-5)\\cdot 1}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{5}^{2}+(-5)^{2}}\\sqrt{(-5)^{2}+(-5)^{2}+{2}^{2}+{1}^{2