set{\\to }{OA}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,b=\\overset{\\to }{OB}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, let $\\theta =m∠AOB$ be the angle between the vectors $a$ and $b.$ Then, we can find $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{‖a‖\\,‖b‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{1}{b}_{1}+{a}_{2}{b}_{2}+{a}_{3}{b}_{3}+{a}_{4}{b}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{1}^{2}+{a}_{2}^{2}+{a}_{3}^{2}+{a}_{4}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{{b}_{1}^{2}+{b}_{2}^{2}+{b}_{3}^{2}+{b}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 3+(-1)\\cdot (-2)}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}+(-2)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{15}\\cdot \\sqrt{15}} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{15} \\\\  & =\\frac{6÷3}{15÷3} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342154 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186341729 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342154 #edb/ref 1069 "q-74110" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342154 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342154 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $A(0,-2,1,-3)$ and $B(-1,2,2,-3).$ Find the cosine of the angle $∠AOB$, where $O(0,0,0,0)$ is the origin." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342154 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b674ce78-18bf-5ff8-a526-99d8937fa2a3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342154 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a=\\overset{\\to }{OA}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],\\,b=\\overset{\\to }{OB}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nAlso, let $\\theta =m∠AOB$ be the angle between the vectors $a$ and $b.$ Then, we can find $\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta $ using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{‖a‖\\,‖b‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{1}{b}_{1}+{a}_{2}{b}_{2}+{a}_{3}{b}_{3}+{a}_{4}{b}_{4}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{1}^{2}+{a}_{2}^{2}+{a}_{3}^{2}+{a}_{4}^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{{b}_{1}^{2}+{b}_{2}^{2}+{b}_{3}^{2}+{b}_{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{0\\cdot (-1)+(-2)\\cdot 2+1\\cdot 2+(-3)\\cdot (-3)}{\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+(-2)^{2}+{1}^{2}+(-3)^{2}}\\,\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-3)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{14}\\cdot \\sqrt{18}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{7}\\cdot 3\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
